  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to hunt; to catch (game)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to hunt; to catch (game)",
      "explanation": "To pursue and catch wild animals or birds, for food or sport. Also appears in fixed words for seasonal outings to enjoy nature."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27767_karu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{鹿|しか}→鹿：04347_shika⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{狩|か}る。",
      "english": "To hunt deer in the mountains.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27767_karu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{昔|むかし}→昔：01515_mukashi⟧、⟦{人々|ひとびと}→人々：03141_hitobito⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{生|い}きる→生きる：01184_ikiru⟧⟦ため→ため：01145_tame⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{動物|どうぶつ}→動物：01480_doubutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{狩|か}った。",
      "english": "Long ago, people hunted animals in order to survive.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27767_karu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{鷹|たか}→鷹：02218_taka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{使|つか}って→使う：00473_tsukau⟧⟦{野鳥|やちょう}→野鳥：14497_yachou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{狩|か}る⟦{伝統|でんとう}→伝統：09585_dentou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{今|いま}→今：00945_ima⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦{残|のこ}っている→残る：01187_nokoru⟧。",
      "english": "The tradition of hunting wild birds with hawks still survives today.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive godan verb. X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{狩|か}る. The basic meaning is hunting wild animals or birds.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{獲物|えもの}→獲物：08638_emono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{狩|か}る: to hunt prey\n- 〜{狩|が}り: a seasonal outing to gather or enjoy something — ⟦{潮干狩|しおひが}り→潮干狩り：18507_shiohigari⟧ (clam digging), ⟦{紅葉狩|もみじが}り→紅葉狩り：05588_momijigari⟧ (autumn-leaf viewing), ぶどう{狩|が}り (grape picking)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{刈|か}る→刈る：02043_karu⟧: to mow, to cut — same reading, different kanji; used for grass, crops, or hair\n- ⟦{捕|つか}まえる→捕まえる：01214_tsukamaeru⟧: to catch — catching without the pursuit or hunting nuance",
